<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Equitable of Iowa cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Equitable of Iowa cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said Wednesday it downgraded Equitable of Iowa Cos to neutral from buy and removed the shares from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Action follows announcement Tuesday that Equitable would be acquired by ING Group.</p>
<p>-- &quot;In our view, the terms of the deal fall within a range of values that are certainly fair,&quot; analyst Ernest Jacob said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Equitable shares rose 1/4 to 66-1/8.  ING's American Depositary shares rose 1-7/16 to 52-15/16.</p>
</text>
